- **Widget & Integration Tests:** Added `test/src/features/document_upload/document_upload_performance_test.dart` (3/3 tests passed):
  - `FileThumbnail` does not trigger PDF rasterization for image files and wraps the image in `ResizeImage` (`cacheWidth`).
  - `DocumentUploadPreparationPage` renders `previewFile` immediately while `fileBytes` is still assembling in the background.
  - `DocumentUploadQueueCoordinator.processQueue` invokes `loadFileBytes()` strictly once even across secondary route pushes/pops.
- **Emulator Verification:** All 3 tests verified on Android Emulator (`Medium_Phone_API_37.0`).
